<title>MALAYSIA: Bescorp requests stock suspension.</title>
<headline>Bescorp requests stock suspension.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bescorp Industries Bhd has requested a suspension in the trading of its stock, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The stock was suspended prior to the midday break. It last traded up 30 cents to 13.60 ringgit.</p>
<p>Officials at the construction and infrastructure firm could not immediately be reached for comment. Earlier this month, Bescorp and another company were reprimanded by the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange for not submitting financial results within three months after their year-ends.</p>
<p>Bescorp's year ended in December. It has sought an extension to May 13 to release its results.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
